You need to go into the Putty configuration, under Window...Selection, and 
change the mouse from "Windows" [1] to xterm.  It still won't behave 
"normally", but at least you won't screw up your game by right clicking.  Do 
watch out for the middle mouse button, since now that one will paste. 

[1] Putty's "Windows" mouse scheme has no relationship to the way the mouse 
behaves in standard Windows applications.

